OL,3,GNEWSANew Dorset trail explores the
OL,4,Astory of ball clay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new trail has been created to tell
OL,7,Fthe story of a little-known clay used
OL,8,Fin everything from pottery to toilets.
OL,10,FBall clay has helped shape Dorset for
OL,11,Fcenturies and now a new walkway has
OL,12,Fbeen created at Purbeck Mining Museum,
OL,13,Fnear Corfe Castle, telling visitors
OL,14,Fabout its role in the county's
OL,15,Findustrial heritage.
OL,17,FBut what exactly is ball clay, and why
OL,18,Fhas it been so important to Purbeck?
OL,20,FBall clay is a fine-grained clay used
OL,21,Fto make ceramics such as toilets,
OL,22,Fsinks, tiles, tableware and pottery.
